WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
It is time to put everything we have learned into practice.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:10.480
On the screen, you will see a video titled, Songs to Help You Remember the Proper BPM.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.240
As you watch, I want you to evaluate the compressions you see.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.120
Look closely at the depth, the rate, and the recoil.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.719
You might notice that some students in the video perform a bit better than others, and

00:00:21.719 --> 00:00:23.799
That is exactly why we practice.

